From 881d9984187c523ee2e963c6b42bc0a97790e0dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:33:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(od-sevev): mobile-first art grid, split and fluid chrome
 core
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Display gains the art grid (cols/rows, cw); L gains cw/dx, the anchor
helpers and split() (whole card rows + a 40-px peek, the reach guard)
in place of the flex rule; the tab slots are floor4(cw/4). The
controller lays the chrome at the canvas origin and centres only the
stage column, pins the tab bar to the safe bottom, fills Row B and the
tab slot only at their reveals, paves the pre-tap floor and the lane,
and publishes cw/S/P/rows/ticker in odDisplay. Views: Row A counter x6
with stretched boxes, the paged two-line ticker, fluid cards with the
growing pill, x5 price and teaser rows, fluid tab slots, the toast
dock stretch and burst pass-through, the Suitcase band, centred
overlays, and the bottom-anchored LEADER_PICK grid (ux/mobile-first-layout.md
§2-§5.8, §8.1-§8.5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
